{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"miter-angle-calculator UI copy.fields.accuracyNote","detected_language":"tl","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"miter-angle-calculator.copy.fields.accuracyNote","keys":["miter-angle-calculator.copy.fields.accuracyNote"],"locale":"fil","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"> Komposisyon kasunduan: spring anggulo ay sinusukat mula sa pader-side likod ng molding. Ang mga resulta ay unsigned nakita-setting magnitudes, hindi kaliwa / kanang pag-uugali. Kumpirmahin ang molding profile, nakita sukat at mga tagubilin ng tagagawa na may isang piraso ng pagsubok bago ang pagputol. Geometry lamang; hindi konstruksiyon o kaligtasan ng payo.","record_id":"071b947f976811bccf2b17fa95fd9d2e4eb113970e9c403cdcceab1d04d0bf2a","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":3.193227499124987,"source":"Compound convention: spring angle is measured from the wall-side back of the molding. Results are unsigned saw-setting magnitudes, not left/right orientation. Confirm the molding profile, saw scale and manufacturer instructions with a test piece before cutting. Geometry only; not construction or safety advice.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"d60604408c00de99505b7c256d0add4c2a9232dbd6383edb34c6d161344e2626","status":"machine-draft","translation":"> Komposisyon kasunduan: spring anggulo ay sinusukat mula sa pader-side likod ng molding. Ang mga resulta ay unsigned nakita-setting magnitudes, hindi kaliwa / kanang pag-uugali. Kumpirmahin ang molding profile, nakita sukat at mga tagubilin ng tagagawa na may isang piraso ng pagsubok bago ang pagputol. Geometry lamang; hindi konstruksiyon o kaligtasan ng payo.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
